D = Distance to be covered
for stationary escalator, $\mathrm{V}_1 \mathrm{t}_1=\mathrm{D}$....(1)
for moving escalator, $\mathrm{V}_2 \mathrm{t}_2=\mathrm{D}$...(2) $\qquad$
for ruma moving on moving escalator, $\left(\mathrm{V}_1+\mathrm{V}_2\right) \mathrm{t}_{\text {req }}=\mathrm{D}$.....(3)
from (1), (2) & (3), we get
$\frac{D}{t_1}+\frac{D}{t_2}=\frac{D}{t_{\text {req }}} \Rightarrow t_{\text {req }}=\frac{t_1 t_2}{t_1+t_2}$
